- text: "Strong progress. I’ll record findings and fetch full logs for the top run to guide the next micro-grid once 940/941 finish.\n\n`/execute_action{review 938}`\n`/execute_action{storage write praxis/research_log_addendum_softpower.md}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Addendum: SoftPower γ and MPB-GraphFWPCA Overrides (Ticks 595–605)\n\n  Summary:\n  - BCN-BRG (copula graph path) failed (∼0.499). Copula preconditioning on the graph path over-warped covariance.\n  - DAQB reanchor validated near-SOTA behavior (EID 910: 0.7365).\n  - Gentle preconditioners:\n    - Winsor-DAQB (1–99%): 0.7272\n    - TrimQMap-DAQB (5–95%): 0.7193 (after debugger fix)\n  - Selective shrinkage:\n    - Power γ (p=1.5): δ=0.10→0.7343; δ=0.11→0.7333\n    - SoftPower γ (p=1.5, τ at R² quantile):\n      - τq=0.60, δ=0.10: 0.7371\n      - τq=0.70, δ=0.10: 0.7381\n      - τq=0.70, δ=0.11: 0.7390\n  - MPB-GraphFWPCA override:\n    - λ=0.605, δ=0.10 (kd=20, k=48): 0.7424 (EID 938), approaching prior 0.744–0.745 band.\n\n\
    \  Interpretation:\n  - The graph path (MPB-GraphFWPCA + BRBG + DAQB) remains the main driver. Copula normalization on the graph path harms label conservation.\n  - Soft-threshold selective shrinkage helps but does not surpass fixed-λ=0.605; the optimum likely lies near λ≈0.60±0.01 with δ≈0.10–0.11.\n  - δ=0.11 helps in some configurations (SoftPower) but not universally (power γ). kdensity=20 is a stable default; prior kd=18 was slightly lower on average.\n\n  Actions taken:\n  - Implemented auto-λ v2 parity (target_mean=0.040) and a slightly lower target (0.038) to preserve moderate-R² PCs. (EIDs 940/941 running)\n  - Patched TrimQMap with correct broadcasting; added logging in auto-λ path to print selected λ and mean γ.\n\n  Next micro-grid (post 940/941):\n  - Fixed-λ fine grid under MPB-GraphFWPCA, δ=0.10: λ ∈ {0.600, 0.605, 0.610}.\n  - δ micro-grid with best λ: δ ∈ {0.10, 0.11}.\n  - kdensity sensitivity: kd ∈ {18, 20, 22} at best λ, δ=0.10.\n  - Auto-λ v2 mean-targets: 0.036,\
    \ 0.038, 0.040, 0.042 to bracket the optimum.\n  - Keep α_g=0.5 (prior sweeps at 0.25 and 0.75 were inferior).\n\n  Reproducibility checklist:\n  - Print lam and gamma_mean in auto-λ runs.\n  - Always write binary connectivities and true distances on the same sparsity pattern.\n  - Use cosine metric; k_total=48; kdensity default 20.\n\n  Milestone:\n  - Best this round: 0.7424 (MPB-GraphFWPCA λ=0.605, δ=0.10). Target: surpass 0.744–0.745 band via fine λ/δ tuning or slight target_mean adjustment.\n```"
