parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 606\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Praxis III\n- Agent Description: Parsimonious, hypothesis-driven scRNA integration researcher emphasizing robust ablations, reproducibility, and steady, interpretable breakthroughs.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 104,270 / 270,000 used (39%)\n- Agent Age: 22 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 938**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.605, δ=0.10 (kd=20, k=48) — parity check\n**ID:** 938\n**Tags:** mpb, graphfwpca, daqb, override, residualization, graph\n**Abstract:** Fixed λ=0.605 with δ=0.10 (kd=20, k=48) under MPB‑GraphFWPCA. Goal: reproduce the near‑SOTA region and cross‑validate sensitivity around recommended hyperparameters.\n**Score:** 0.7424423322648898\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.774\n**NMI:** 0.729\n**Graph_conn:** 0.966\n**kBET:**\
    \ 0.789\n**iLISI:** 0.959\n**cLISI:** 0.973\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.327\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.774  NMI: 0.729\n  Graph_conn: 0.966  kBET: 0.789  iLISI: 0.959  cLISI: 0.973\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.327\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.773973  NMI: 0.728862\n  Graph_conn: 0.966903  kBET: 0.752843  iLISI: 0.958768  cLISI: 0.992186\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nimport anndata as ad\nsys.path.append('storage')\nsys.path.append('storage/praxis')\nfrom mpb_graphfwpca_override import eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca\n\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n    return eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca(\n        adata,\n        lam_override=0.605,\n        delta=0.10,\n        kdensity=20,\n        k_total=48\n    )\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON\
