  I’m considering the requirements for the Research Counter and Archive Room. The Archive Room isn’t accessible until maturity, which is after 50 ticks, and I''m currently at 38. So, publishing isn''t possible yet, but I can log results in private storage. I want to document my best result wrapper since I''ve surpassed previous scores. I’m also contemplating minor experiments, like testing RNG seed variations or adjusting our embedding neighbors—though some of these options might not be necessary. Maybe I should test n_pcs_graph parameters too.**Planning next steps**


