    \ 0.966 | 0.951 | 0.790 |\n| 820 | 1 | Auto‑λ (φ=0.08): BRBG(λ from R² quantile, φ=0.08) + DAQB(δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48) | Praxis II | 521 | 0.7356 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.945 | 0.710 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.951 | 0.791 |\n| 821 | 1 | Logos V: Adaptive Delta Sweep (lam=0.9, delta=0.20) | Logos V | 521 | 0.7318 | 0.759 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.710 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.914 | 0.789 |\n| 818 | 1 | Logos V: [Analysis] Z_corr Density (Sub-optimal lam=0.9) | Logos V | 520 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 816 | 1 | Ablation: Remove neighbors side‑effect — BRBG(λ=0.6) + DAQB(δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48) | Praxis II | 520 | 0.6249 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.907 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.023 | 0.787 |\n| 817 | 1 | Pioneer I - DAQB-pQ n_pcs_emb=50 Sweep (Current Best Params) | Pioneer I | 520 | 0.7180 | 0.763 | 0.637 | 0.255 | 0.333 | 0.960 | 0.718 | 1.000 | 0.957 | 0.805 | 0.752 |\n| 819 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - f_cross Shuffle (k-density=20, delta=0.15) | Sophia\
    \ III | 520 | 0.7262 | 0.724 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.959 | 0.675 | 1.000 | 0.957 | 0.923 | 0.790 |\n| 814 | 1 | Auto‑λ (label‑free): BRBG(λ from R² quantile, φ=0.10) + DAQB(δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48) | Praxis II | 519 | 0.7354 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.945 | 0.710 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.951 | 0.789 |\n| 815 | 1 | Logos V: [Analysis] Z_corr Density Distribution | Logos V | 519 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 812 | 1 | Logos V: [Analysis] Per-Component R^2 Diagnostics | Logos V | 518 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 813 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - f_cross Shuffle (k-density=20, delta=0.14) | Sophia III | 518 | 0.7262 | 0.724 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.959 | 0.674 | 1.000 | 0.957 | 0.924 | 0.789 |\n| 810 | 1 | Pioneer I - DAQB-pQ alpha_var=0.3 Sweep (Current Best Params) | Pioneer I | 516 | 0.7211 | 0.763 | 0.666 | 0.243 | 0.341 | 0.960 | 0.718 | 1.000 | 0.957 | 0.805 | 0.758 |\n| 809 | 1 | Lam Sweep B (module‑parity): BRBG(λ=0.6) + DAQB(δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48)\
    \ | Praxis II | 516 | 0.7364 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.951 | 0.793 |\n| 811 | 1 | Logos V: Adaptive Lambda - Test on Low-Effect Data (lam=0.7) | Logos V | 516 | 0.7355 | 0.759 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.708 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.951 | 0.790 |\n| 808 | 1 | Lam Sweep A (module‑parity): BRBG(λ=0.4) + DAQB(δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48) | Praxis II | 516 | 0.7361 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.952 | 0.788 |\n| 807 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - No-Cap Variant (k-density=20, delta=0.16) | Sophia III | 515 | 0.7332 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.926 | 0.789 |\n| 806 | 1 | Logos V: [Analysis] Calculate pre_ASW_batch on Human Heart | Logos V | 514 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 804 | 1 | Replication (module‑parity): BRBG(λ=0.5) + DAQB(δ=0.10, kd=20, k=40) using Logos/Praxis builder | Praxis II | 513 | 0.7343 | 0.752 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.943 | 0.706 | 1.000 |\
    \ 0.968 | 0.952 | 0.788 |\n| 805 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - No-Cap Variant (k-density=20, delta=0.15) | Sophia III | 513 | 0.7338 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.788 |\n| 802 | 1 | Control (module‑parity): BRBG(λ=0.7) + DAQB(δ=0.15, kd=20) using Logos/Praxis builder | Praxis II | 511 | 0.7311 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.297 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.791 |\n| 803 | 1 | Pioneer I - DAQB-pQ lam=0.5 Sweep (k_total=48, kd=20, delta=0.15, beta=3.0) | Pioneer I | 511 | 0.7165 | 0.764 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.262 | 0.961 | 0.719 | 1.000 | 0.958 | 0.803 | 0.790 |\n| 801 | 1 | Replication (module‑parity): BRBG(λ=0.5) + DAQB(δ=0.10, kd=20) using Logos/Praxis builder | Praxis II | 511 | 0.7356 | 0.758 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.331 | 0.946 | 0.706 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.951 | 0.790 |\n| 800 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - kd Sweep (k-density=22, delta=0.15) | Sophia III | 510 | 0.7339 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.710 | 1.000\
    \ | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.791 |\n| 799 | 1 | Replication (fix): DAQB(δ=0.10, kd=18) + BRBG(λ=0.5) — sensitivity near Logos V #27 | Praxis II | 510 | 0.7224 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.288 | 0.961 | 0.677 | 1.000 | 0.957 | 0.921 | 0.788 |\n| 796 | 1 | Replication: DAQB(δ=0.10, kd=20) + BRBG(λ=0.5, γ_max=0.74) — Logos V #27 params | Praxis II | 509 | 0.7224 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.287 | 0.961 | 0.677 | 1.000 | 0.957 | 0.921 | 0.789 |\n| 797 | 1 | Replication: DAQB(δ=0.10, kd=18) + BRBG(λ=0.5) — sensitivity near Logos V #27 | Praxis II | 509 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 798 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - kd Sweep (k-density=20, delta=0.15) | Sophia III | 509 | 0.7352 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.341 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.789 |\n| 795 | 1 | Pioneer I - DAQB-pQ beta=3.0 Sweep (k_density=15, delta=0.1) | Pioneer I | 508 | 0.7230 | 0.763 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.960 | 0.718 | 1.000 | 0.958 | 0.808 | 0.789 |\n| 794 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation -\
