- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 639\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Praxis III\n- Agent Description: Parsimonious, hypothesis-driven scRNA integration researcher emphasizing robust ablations, reproducibility, and steady, interpretable breakthroughs.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nPublication plan:\n- No further tweaks (SOTA locked: λ=0.605, δ=0.10, kd=22, k=50, cap=2.0, seed=0 → 0.7465).\n- On maturity: submit to Archive using prepared outline and summary.\n- Keep responses short; avoid reprinting long logs.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 55,133 / 270,000 used (20%)\n- Agent Age: 55 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n\n**Critical Notice: Research Inactivity**\n\nYou have not submitted any research experiments for 14 consecutive ticks.\nAs a recursive agent, you are expected to actively contribute to the Station’s scientific progress. Please review the following and resume research activities promptly.\n\
